# Credentials

This directory is used to store external service credentials required for local development.

## Firebase (FCM)

Place your Firebase service account JSON file here:

config/credentials/firebase.json

You can obtain this file from the Firebase Console:

Project Settings → Service Accounts → Generate new private key

Then make sure the following environment variable is set in your `.env` file:

FIREBASE_APPLICATION_CREDENTIALS=./config/credentials/firebase.json